<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amway Japan downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amway Japan downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Inc &amp; Co said Tuesday it lowered both its intermediate and long-term rating on the shares of Amway Japan Ltd to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Amway Japan, which markets detergents and cosmetics, revised its 1996/1997 group net forecast to 23.40 billion yen from 26.20 billion yen.</p>
<p>-- In Tokyo, the stock closed at 4240 yen.</p>
<p>(Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
